        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rupert Julian, Robert Z. Leonard\n- Films: The Girl Who Ran Wild, The Divorcee\n- Companies: Universal\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director\n\nFacts:\n- Rupert Julian was born on 25 January 1879 and died on 27 December 1943.\n- Rupert Julian was the first New Zealand cinema actor, director, writer, and producer.\n- Robert Z. Leonard was born on October 7, 1889 and died on August 27, 1968.\n- Robert Z. Leonard was an American film director, actor, producer, and screenwriter.\n- The Girl Who Ran Wild is a 1922 Universal film directed by Rupert Julian.\n- The Divorcee was directed by Robert Z. Leonard.\n- Robert Z. Leonard was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for The Divorcee.",
